  "definition": "Dispensing Practices",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-07-22",
  "historyNote": "#8572, eff 2-23-06; amd by #9139-B, eff 4-25-08; paragraphs (c) and (d) EXPIRED: 2-23-14 paragraphs (a) & (b) EXPIRED: 4-25-16 New. #12335, eff 7-22-17",
